{
  "vendor": "huawei",
  "model": "OptiXtrans E9624",
  "label": "OptiXtrans E9624 OTN subrack, 1:1 mode, 24x TNG1N210 (240x 10G line)",
  "category": "switch",
  "description": "Huawei OptiXtrans E9624 - 747.2 mm (16.8U) metro/core OTN subrack whose service-slot count depends on the cross-connect protection mode: 1:1 mode gives 12 large or 24 small slots, 1:3 mode 10 large or 20 small. Unlike its E9612/E9605 siblings it carries real cross-connect boards (TNG1CXP, TNG3CXP or TNG4CXP in IU71/IU72) and accepts OTN tributary and packet boards as well as line boards. Modelled in 1:1 mode, fully populated with 24x TNG1N210 line boards in IU1-IU24: 240x 10G WDM-side line ports, each carrying one OTU2 or OTU2e wavelength.",
